# 功能策略
🔰 节点选择 = select,DIRECT,🤖 自动选择,🎯 手动切换,🛡️ 故障转移,🔮 负载均衡,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Magic.png
🎯 手动切换 = select,全球节点,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Area.png
🤖 自动选择 = url-test,全球节点,url = http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204,interval = 60,tolerance = 500,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Auto.png
🛡️ 故障转移 = fallback,全球节点,url = http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204,interval = 300,max-timeout = 3000,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Available.png
🔮 负载均衡 = load-balance,全球节点,url = http://www.gstatic.com/generate_204,interval = 300,max-timeout = 3000,algorithm = pcc,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Round_Robin.png
🍃 应用净化 = select,REJECT,DIRECT,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Hijacking.png
🚫 广告拦截 = select,REJECT,DIRECT,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Advertising.png
🆎 AdBlock = select,REJECT,DIRECT,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/AdBlack.png
🌐 全球直连 = select,DIRECT,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Direct.png
🐟 漏网之鱼 = select,DIRECT,img-url = https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Koolson/Qure/master/IconSet/Color/Final.png

